<title>USA: Apertus signs reseller pact with Digital.</title>
<headline>Apertus signs reseller pact with Digital.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apertus Technologies Inc said Wednesday it entered an agreement under which Digital Equipment Corp will resell Apertus' EXPRESS UNIX software on Digital computers that require mainframe host access.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, Apertus will port its software to Digital's AlphaServer family of computer systems.</p>
<p>Apertus projects that the agreement will result in multi-million dollar revenues over time. But a spokeswoman would not be more specific.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
